  "instructions": [
    "Warm tortillas in a dry skillet for 30 seconds each side until pliable.",
    "Spread a thin layer of honey over each tortilla, then sprinkle smoked paprika.",
    "Lay two slices of kosher serrano ham on each tortilla, followed by a generous sprinkle of mozzarella.",
    "Add sautéed red onions and chopped roasted almonds on top of the cheese.",
    "Drizzle lemon juice over the filling and season with salt and pepper.",
    "Fold the sides of the tortilla over the filling and roll tightly into a wrap.",
    "Place the wrapped tortillas seam side down in a preheated skillet and cook for 2-3 minutes per side until the cheese melts and the tortilla crisps.",
    "Slice each wrap in half diagonally and garnish with fresh basil before serving."
  ],
